Short:        Source for playing DT/EP Custom-modules
Author:       ki9656@unidhp.uni-c.dk (Mikael Lund)
Uploader:     ki9656 unidhp uni-c dk (Mikael Lund)
Type:         dev/asm
Version:      1.1
Replaces:     acustpl1.lha
Architecture: generic

Customplay v1.1 - This is an assembler source for using Delitracker
custom-modules in your own code. It works almost like any other player
where you need to call init-, play- and end-routines.

v1.0 to v1.1 :	Only the Doc & Examples are changed.

